OL,3,GNEWSADJ ends 50-year career in the club
OL,4,Awhere it began
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a DJ career spanning half a
OL,7,Fcentury, Brian Pearce is preparing to
OL,8,Fperform his final vinyl set at the same
OL,9,Fclub he played his first mix in 1976.
OL,11,FPearce, 77, aka DJ Tom Bryan, from
OL,12,FStanground, Peterborough, said he
OL,13,Fstarted to DJ "by accident" after he
OL,14,Fbrought his record player to provide
OL,15,Fmusic for a work party.
OL,17,FFollowing his success at the event, a
OL,18,Flocal entertainment agent contacted
OL,19,FPearce and secured him a gig at
OL,20,FAnnabelles night club in Peterborough,
OL,21,Fnow called The Met Lounge, 50 years
OL,22,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
