OL,3,GNEWSADJ ends 50-year career in the club
OL,4,Awhere it began
OL,5,
OL,6,FPearce said his DJ sets have
OL,7,Fcontributed to a "brilliant life" and
OL,8,Fafter collecting over 12,000 vinyl
OL,9,Fsingles he felt it was now time to hang
OL,10,Fup his headphones.
